{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1786084607834", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "我发现了重要的先前工作。图像压缩领域已有关于“Idempotent Learned Image Compression with Right-Inverse”的论文 (NeurIPS 2023)，以及“Idempotence and Perceptual Image Compression” (ICLR 2024)。此外还有 O'Reilly 等人的“Code Drift”论文，该论文通过 loss fine-tuning 实现了 idempotence（但没有提供 construction-based 的保证）。让我再检查一个关键方面——基于 construction-based 的 idempotence 思想是否在图像压缩中被先驱性地提出，以及 LILAC 是否在音频领域真正开创了这一先河。"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "14d8efa8-4fea-4b88-be92-afc623b5bcb8", "uuid": "7839632f-57cd-40cd-b36f-6db556ace5b2"}
